[hero]
type: label

<hero-announce>
source: "CLIFF 1.1 已发布"
target: "CLIFF 1.1 is out"
status: translated

<hero-announce-link>
source: "阅读更新日志"
target: "Read the changelog"
status: translated

<hero-title-1>
source: "上下文，"
target: "Context,"
status: translated

<hero-title-2>
source: "就是格式。"
target: "is the format."
status: translated

<hero-lede>
source: "一个面向完整本地化生命周期的逐行工作文件。家族、分组与条目的上下文随字符串流动——译者读得懂，模型改得动，校验一次通过。"
target: "A line-oriented working file for the whole localization lifecycle. Clan, group, and entry context travels with every string — readable by translators, editable by models, validated in one pass."
type: description
status: translated

<hero-action-spec>
source: "阅读规范"
target: "Read the spec"
status: translated

<hero-action-github>
source: "在 GitHub 查看"
target: "View on GitHub"
status: translated

<hero-proof-version>
source: "v1.1 稳定版"
target: "v1.1 stable"
status: translated

<hero-proof-license>
source: "MIT 许可"
target: "MIT license"
status: translated

<hero-proof-tested>
source: "与 10 种格式同场实测"
target: "Benchmarked against 10 formats"
status: translated

<hero-figure-context>
source: "上下文保留"
target: "context retained"
status: translated

<hero-figure-tokens>
source: "更少 Token"
target: "fewer tokens"
status: translated

<hero-validated>
source: "校验通过"
target: "validated"
status: translated

<hero-fixes>
source: "0 处修复"
target: "0 fixes"
status: translated

[lifecycle]
type: label

<lifecycle-heading-1>
source: "从提取，"
target: "From extraction,"
status: translated

<lifecycle-heading-2>
source: "到交付。"
target: "to delivery."
status: translated

<lifecycle-lede>
source: "CLIFF 不是一次性的交接物。同一个文件经历提取、翻译、审校与交付，上下文在每一步都保留下来，而不是被重建。"
target: "A CLIFF file is not a one-off handoff. The same file goes through extraction, translation, review, and delivery, and the context survives every step instead of being rebuilt."
type: description
status: translated

<lifecycle-extract-title>
source: "提取"
target: "Extract"
status: translated

<lifecycle-extract-body>
source: "导入器把既有键折叠成分组路径，并保留源拼写作为匹配键。"
target: "The importer folds existing keys into group paths and keeps the source spelling as the match key."
type: description
status: translated

<lifecycle-translate-title>
source: "翻译"
target: "Translate"
status: translated

<lifecycle-translate-body>
source: "译者能在同一个文件里看到家族、分组与条目上下文；模型拿到的是一份安全、低 Token 的文档。"
target: "Translators see clan, group, and entry context in one file; models receive a safe, low-token document."
type: description
status: translated

<lifecycle-review-title>
source: "审校"
target: "Review"
status: translated

<lifecycle-review-body>
source: "必填标签与封闭词表让审校变得可机械检查。每处修复都会被报告，绝不会静默编造。"
target: "Required fields and closed vocabularies make review mechanically checkable. Every repair is reported and nothing is silently invented."
type: description
status: translated

<lifecycle-deliver-title>
source: "交付"
target: "Deliver"
status: translated

<lifecycle-deliver-body>
source: "导出到运行时、引擎清单或翻译记忆，不必重建最初的上下文。"
target: "Export to a runtime, an engine manifest, or a translation memory without rebuilding the original context."
type: description
status: translated

